        "zh-Hant": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "使用 Google Lens 文字辨識？" } }
      }
    },
    "Recognizing an entire manga sends a reduced copy of every page without Mokuro text to Google. Results are cached on this Mac so reopening does not recognize the same pages again. Google Lens requires an internet connection.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Recognizing an entire manga sends a reduced copy of every page without Mokuro text to Google. Results are cached on this Mac so reopening does not recognize the same pages again. Google Lens requires an internet connection." } },
        "zh-Hans": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "识别整本漫画时，每个不含 Mokuro 文字的页面都会以缩小副本发送给 Google。结果会缓存在这台 Mac 上，重新打开时不会重复识别相同页面。Google Lens 需要网络连接。" } },
        "zh-Hant": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "辨識整本漫畫時，每個不含 Mokuro 文字的頁面都會以縮小副本傳送給 Google。結果會快取在這台 Mac 上，重新開啟時不會重複辨識相同頁面。Google Lens 需要網路連線。" } }
      }
    },
