    "A **[Google Cloud project](https://github.com/ttu-ttu/ebook-reader?tab=readme-ov-file#storage-sources)** is necessary for syncing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要创建一个 **[Google Cloud 项目](https://github.com/ttu-ttu/ebook-reader?tab=readme-ov-file#storage-sources)** 进行同步。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同步需要一個 **[Google Cloud 專案](https://github.com/ttu-ttu/ebook-reader?tab=readme-ov-file#storage-sources)**。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1. After the initial setup, create another **OAuth client ID** in the same project.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. 初始设置完成后，在同一项目中再创建一个 **OAuth 客户端 ID**。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. 初始設定完成後，在同一專案中建立另一個 **OAuth 用戶端 ID**。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2. Select **iOS** as the **Application type** and set the **Bundle ID** to '**moe.shishamo.hoshi**'.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2. 选择 **iOS** 作为 **应用类型**，并将 **Bundle ID** 设置为“**moe.shishamo.hoshi**”。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2. 選擇 **iOS** 作為**應用程式類型**，並將 **Bundle ID** 設為「**moe.shishamo.hoshi**」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3. Paste the **Client ID** in the textbox below and press '**Connect Google Drive**'.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3. 将 **客户端 ID** 粘贴到下面的文本框中，然后点击“**连接 Google Drive**”。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3. 將**用戶端 ID** 貼到下方文字方塊並點選「**連接 Google Drive**」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "4. You can sync individual books by long-pressing and selecting '**Sync**'.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "4. 你可以长按单本书并选择“**同步**”来同步。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "4. 長按書籍並選擇「**同步**」即可同步單本書。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
