    "Importing a .colpkg/.apkg backup from Anki will allow Niratan to check for duplicates immediately. It's recommended to do this periodically to reduce drift.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "导入 Anki 的 .colpkg/.apkg 备份后，Niratan 可以立即检查重复。建议定期导入以减少偏差。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "导入 Anki 的 .colpkg/.apkg 备份后，Niratan 可以立即检查重复。建议定期导入以减少偏差。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
