          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "嵌入媒体会增加释义内容大小（AnkiMobile）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Higher quality produces larger cards. Image compression applies to book covers and video screenshots; repeated cards reuse matching media files.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "质量越高，卡片体积越大。图片压缩适用于书籍封面和视频截图；重复制卡会复用相同的媒体文件。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "品質越高，卡片體積越大。圖片壓縮適用於書籍封面和影片截圖；重複製卡會複用相同的媒體檔案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Animated AVIF stores independent frames for reliable iOS playback. Lower resolution or frame rate produces smaller cards.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Animated AVIF stores independent frames for reliable iOS playback. Lower resolution or frame rate produces smaller cards."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "动画 AVIF 使用独立帧以确保在 iOS 上可靠播放；降低分辨率或帧率可以减小卡片体积。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "動畫 AVIF 使用獨立影格以確保在 iOS 上可靠播放；降低解析度或影格率可以減小卡片體積。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This will refresh decks and models while preserving mappings for fields that still exist.": {
